# MSA + gRPC Phase 1: Distributed Microservices Architecture

**목표**: gRPC 기반 서비스 통신 구축
**규모**: 3,000줄, 40/40 테스트, 10/10 규칙
**기간**: 2026-03-05 (1일)

---

## 📊 **5개 모듈 구조**

### **Module 1: Service Registry (700줄)**
- Service registration/deregistration
- Instance discovery
- Health checking
- Version management
- Test suite: R1-R8 (8개)

### **Module 2: Load Balancer (650줄)**
- Round-robin strategy
- Least-connections strategy
- Weighted routing
- Health-aware balancing
- Test suite: L1-L8 (8개)

### **Module 3: gRPC Communication (600줄)**
- Protocol buffer simulation
- Request/response handling
- Streaming support
- Error handling
- Test suite: G1-G8 (8개)

### **Module 4: Fault Tolerance (550줄)**
- Circuit breaker pattern
- Retry logic with backoff
- Timeout management
- Bulkhead isolation
- Test suite: F1-F8 (8개)

### **Module 5: Service Mesh Integration (500줄)**
- Inter-service communication
- Distributed tracing
- Metrics collection
- Configuration management
- Test suite: M1-M8 (8개)

---

## 🎯 **10개 무관용 규칙**

| 규칙 | 요구사항 | 검증 |
|------|---------|------|
| **R1** | Service discovery < 100ms | Registry lookup time |
| **R2** | Load balance < 10ms | Routing latency |
| **R3** | RPC latency < 50ms | Message roundtrip |
| **R4** | Circuit breaker < 1s | Response time |
| **R5** | Retry success ≥ 95% | Recovery rate |
| **R6** | No cascading failures | Isolation test |
| **R7** | Distributed tracing 100% | Trace coverage |
| **R8** | Service health check < 5s | Health check interval |
| **R9** | Version compatibility | Versioning support |
| **R10** | Config update < 500ms | Config propagation |

